{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"gloss-detail","href":"/shijing/gloss/049-chun-zhi-ben-ben/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0001-1","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/gloss/049-chun-zhi-ben-ben/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0001-1/data.json","title":"詩經注析 · 题解 · 程俊英、蒋见元 · 题解","description":"風 · 鄘風 · 鶉之奔奔 · 《詩經注析》关于“题解”的注脚：题解指出《鹑之奔奔》是一首人民讽刺、责骂卫国君主的诗。程、蒋先综述毛序、郑笺及姚际恒、方玉润等诸说，认为“人”“我”“兄”“君”的指向历来分歧，…"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"049-chun-zhi-ben-ben","materialId":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","glossId":"0001-1"},"href":"/shijing/gloss/049-chun-zhi-ben-ben/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0001-1","poem":{"id":"049-chun-zhi-ben-ben","title":"鶉之奔奔","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"yongfeng","path":["風","鄘風","鶉之奔奔"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"鹑之奔奔","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-002","text":"鹊之彊彊","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-003","text":"人之无良","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-004","text":"我以为兄","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-005","text":"鹊之彊彊","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-006","text":"鹑之奔奔","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-007","text":"人之无良","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-008","text":"我以为君","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi","title":"詩經注析","authors":["程俊英","蔣見元"],"contributorLine":"现代 · 程俊英、蔣見元","era":"现代","publicationYear":1991,"carrier":"PDF"},"annotation":{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":3,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"题解","targetNotes":"题解总说。","sourceLabel":"第 104-105 页","sourceNotes":"书内页 104-105《题解》段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"程俊英、蒋见元","sectionLabel":"题解","text":"题解指出《鹑之奔奔》是一首人民讽刺、责骂卫国君主的诗。程、蒋先综述毛序、郑笺及姚际恒、方玉润等诸说，认为“人”“我”“兄”“君”的指向历来分歧，不宜拘守一端。其后又引《左传》与杜预注，强调本篇可从民歌立场理解；就作者身份而言，以陈奂“我，国人也”之说较可从。题解并指出首章“鹑之奔奔，鹊之彊彊”兼有比兴作用，重在以禽鸟有匹偶反衬人伦失序。","notes":null}]},"siblings":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"layerLabel":"全篇总说","title":"题解","href":"/shijing/gloss/049-chun-zhi-ben-ben/chengjunying-jiangjianyuan-zhuxi/0001-1","isCurrent":true},{"id":"0002","order":2,"layerLabel":"诗句片段","title":"鹑之奔奔，